@ChatWithPdf.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7094

### List documents
GET {{ChatWithPdf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload PDF
POST {{ChatWithPdf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
------Boundary--

###

### Ask a question
POST {{ChatWithPdf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is this document about?",
  "documentId": null
}

###
